== [    BASIC ] ============================================================================================
   MNEMONIC: invlpg [ENC: DEFAULT, MAP: 0F, OPC: 0x01]
     LENGTH:  3
        SSZ: 64
       EOSZ:  8
       EASZ: 64
   CATEGORY: SYSTEM
    ISA-SET: I486REAL
    ISA-EXT: BASE
 EXCEPTIONS: NONE
 ATTRIBUTES: HAS_MODRM IS_PRIVILEGED ACCEPTS_SEGMENT 
  OPTIMIZED: 0F 01 38 

== [ OPERANDS ] ============================================================================================
##       TYPE  VISIBILITY  ACTION      ENCODING   SIZE  NELEM  ELEMSZ  ELEMTYPE                        VALUE
--  ---------  ----------  ------  ------------   ----  -----  ------  --------  ---------------------------
 0     MEMORY    EXPLICIT    NONE      MODRM_RM      8      1       8      UINT  TYPE  =                 MEM
                                                                                 SEG   =                  ds
                                                                                 BASE  =                 rax
                                                                                 INDEX =                none
                                                                                 SCALE =                   0
                                                                                 DISP  =  0x0000000000000000
--  ---------  ----------  ------  ------------   ----  -----  ------  --------  ---------------------------

== [      ATT ] ============================================================================================
   ABSOLUTE: invlpg (%rax)
   RELATIVE: invlpg (%rax)

== [    INTEL ] ============================================================================================
   ABSOLUTE: invlpg byte ptr ds:[rax]
   RELATIVE: invlpg byte ptr ds:[rax]

== [ SEGMENTS ] ============================================================================================
0F 01 38 
:     :..MODRM
:..OPCODE
